Warning [L0513] (redundant_tail_return): This arm table is followed by a default return that can be its explicit `else` arm
  --> tests/ui_lint/redundant_tail_return.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     if value == {
    |     ^^
 Why: The value-table form keeps all outcomes together and lets the block return its final expression
 Fix: Replace the table and fallback with an explicit `else` arm
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0513

Warning [L0530] (redundant_final_return): An explicit `return` is used on the final value line
  --> tests/ui_lint/redundant_tail_return.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     return "other"
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: An unadorned expression on the final value line is Jet's implicit return; `return` is for early exits
 Fix: Remove the final `return` and leave the expression as the block tail
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0530

